        <activityName xml:lang="en">Crude oil, used in drilling tests</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Crude oil, used in drilling tests
Inventory of emissions from crude oil combustion.;
UUID: a60c9cf4-c057-3510-813a-d92a65db76fc
Crude oil use and air emissions from combustion of crude oil during drilling tests.
Location: Data investigated in NO.
Technology: Drilling test in the North Sea.
Time period: Time of publication in literature
Production volume: 31.6 kg of crude oil are burned for one drilling metre
Sampling: Single measurements published in literature. 
Extrapolations: From NO, sea to GLO
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a60c9cf4-c057-3510-813a-d92a65db76fc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
